# ===================================================================
# SECRETS — GLOB PATTERNS, NOT ONE-OFF NAMES.
# Every dated .env backup (.env.bak-wa-*, .env.bak-devsafe-*, ...) is
# caught by `.env*` below. NEVER add a literal dated filename here —
# the next backup will have a different date and slip straight through.
# ===================================================================
.env*
!.env.example
*.env
*.env-*
temp_env.txt

# credential / API dumps and DB snapshots
doc/
*-adminsdk-*.json
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
storage/*.json
*.sql.gz
*.dump
